@@ -156,6 +156,12 @@ You can also target a specific migration set using ``migration_set:migration_nam
       --stop-before sales:drop_index
 
 The ``--stop-before`` option can be passed more than once.
+Migration names are validated before any migrations are applied, so an unknown
+name causes the command to exit with an error without applying migrations.
+
+Legacy duck-typed migration collections support one stop point per collection.
+Passing multiple stop points that match one of those collections causes the
+command to exit with an error.
 
